  "description": "LAWFUL DEVELOPMENT CERTIFICATE IN RESPECT OF THE PROPOSED ERECTION OF A HIP TO GABLE AND REAR DORMER ROOF EXTENSION AND INSERTION OF X2 ROOFLIGHTS TO FRONT ROOFSLOPE",
